{"role":"assistant","content":"Задача ясна: `build_system` собирает системный промпт одним блоком с одним маркером `cache_control`, и каждый `save_fact` меняет хвост фактов → промах по всему префиксу. Разобью на два блока.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_m0wMlLEK03J9ZYkgEx8Mtae6","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"/private/tmp/h-rSNjVD/bot.py\",\"old_string\":\"def build_system(a, today):\\n    # One block, cached as a whole: instructions + per-athlete context.\\n    text = INSTRUCTIONS + \\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\" + athlete_context(a, today)\\n    return [{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": text, \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}}]\",\"new_string\":\"def build_system(a, today):\\n    # Two cached segments: segment 1 is the instructions, byte-stable for every\\n    # athlete and every day; segment 2 is the per-athlete tail (date, profile,\\n    # zones, goal, facts, language). save_fact only rewrites segment 2, so the\\n    # big static prefix stays a cache hit.\\n    return [\\n        {\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": INSTRUCTIONS, \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}},\\n        {\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": athlete_context(a, today), \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}},\\n    ]\"}"}}]}
